    "meta": {
        "instanceId": "bcc-nightlife-omnichannel",
        "_readme": "BCC Omnichannel Chat Workflow — Import this into your n8n instance. SETUP STEPS: 1) Set the env variable OMNICHANNEL_WEBHOOK_SECRET in both n8n and Vercel to match. 2) Connect your WhatsApp Business API (Twilio/WABA/360dialog) to the WhatsApp Incoming webhook. 3) Connect Instagram Graph API to the Instagram Incoming webhook. 4) Connect Facebook Page webhook to the Facebook Incoming webhook. 5) After the 'Prepare Reply' nodes, add your channel-specific SEND nodes (e.g., Twilio Send SMS for WhatsApp, HTTP Request to Graph API for IG/FB). The Reply Prep nodes output the formatted message — you just need to wire them to your send API."
    }
